(6753044, 1011257, 14001, '<td valign="top">Very nice, well done.  The whites are a little blown out at his mid-section, could have used some additional PP in my opinion to reduce that overall harsh tones, more saturation, black point, contrast and mid tones.  Would have liked the crop to be a little lower, but that''s your call, not sure this is truly panning either since your likely in a chase vehicle, but still nice work.</td>', 'Very nice, well done.  The whites are a little blown out at his mid-section, could have used some additional PP in my opinion to reduce that overall harsh tones, more saturation, black point, contrast and mid tones.  Would have liked the crop to be a little lower, but that''s your call, not sure this is truly panning either since your likely in a chase vehicle, but still nice work.', '2012-04-27 08:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6753045, 1011819, 14001, '<td valign="top">This is really an interesting image, my 2nd favorite in the group, if the Cowboy''s head would have been sharp it would be a 10 for me, 9.</td>', 'This is really an interesting image, my 2nd favorite in the group, if the Cowboy''s head would have been sharp it would be a 10 for me, 9.', '2012-04-27 08:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6753047, 1011076, 14001, '<td valign="top">Here''s the best image in the group with sharpness and background blur because you image is traveling so fast so your shutter speed can be so much quicker.  Shot at night though, so noise becomes an issue from high ISO''s, but I see not at this resolution, so really good shot.  My only criticism is the background is really not very good, appears to be a chain link fence and RV''s.  9.</td>', 'Here''s the best image in the group with sharpness and background blur because you image is traveling so fast so your shutter speed can be so much quicker.  Shot at night though, so noise becomes an issue from high ISO''s, but I see not at this resolution, so really good shot.  My only criticism is the background is really not very good, appears to be a chain link fence and RV''s.  9.', '2012-04-27 08:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6753050, 1011298, 14001, '<td valign="top">Clever, really neat shot, I must give you credit.  Very creative.  However, I''m not really sure she is moving at all.  Initially I thought she was spinning and you were in the center, but the extra fill light with the harsh shadow on her chest suggests artificial lighting.  Which makes me think maybe the blur was post.  Anyway, I still like it.  8.</td>', 'Clever, really neat shot, I must give you credit.  Very creative.  However, I''m not really sure she is moving at all.  Initially I thought she was spinning and you were in the center, but the extra fill light with the harsh shadow on her chest suggests artificial lighting.  Which makes me think maybe the blur was post.  Anyway, I still like it.  8.', '2012-04-27 08:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6753051, 1011866, 14001, '<td valign="top">Excellent panning and movement.  The background blur is very distracting however, choppy I guess.  Nice shot, 8.</td>', 'Excellent panning and movement.  The background blur is very distracting however, choppy I guess.  Nice shot, 8.', '2012-04-27 08:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6753053, 1011454, 14001, '<td valign="top">Really fun!  Really meets the challenge, nice combined sharpness and blur.  LIke the PP, but maybe could have increased highlights to see faces on left better.  9.</td>', 'Really fun!  Really meets the challenge, nice combined sharpness and blur.  LIke the PP, but maybe could have increased highlights to see faces on left better.  9.', '2012-04-27 08:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6753055, 1011945, 14001, '<td valign="top">Very clean and well done.  PP needs more saturation, dark point and mid tones to really make it POP and remove some of the flatness, IMO.  9.</td>', 'Very clean and well done.  PP needs more saturation, dark point and mid tones to really make it POP and remove some of the flatness, IMO.  9.', '2012-04-27 08:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6753056, 1011878, 14001, '<td valign="top">Fun and unique.  9.</td>', 'Fun and unique.  9.', '2012-04-27 08:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
