(6756719, 1011773, 132996, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this image, it looks like something reminiscent of Native American artwork. There is an absolutely gorgeous sense of motion with the squiggly lines behind the bear. The only thing I don''t like is the flat colors. I''m not completely sure what could be added, but there is a little something missing. Overall, however, it''s a stunning image.</td>', 'I absolutely love this image, it looks like something reminiscent of Native American artwork. There is an absolutely gorgeous sense of motion with the squiggly lines behind the bear. The only thing I don''t like is the flat colors. I''m not completely sure what could be added, but there is a little something missing. Overall, however, it''s a stunning image.', '2012-05-01 16:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756721, 1011768, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and good job.</td>', 'Excellent idea and good job.', '2012-05-01 16:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756730, 1011443, 12611, '<td valign="top">love the drama and colors</td>', 'love the drama and colors', '2012-05-01 16:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756731, 1011669, 132996, '<td valign="top">This is by far my favorite picture in the challenge. You captured such striking a motion in the creature. I would say the composition isn''t exactly perfect, but the sheer emotion and whimsical nature of the image totally and captures the viewer.</td>', 'This is by far my favorite picture in the challenge. You captured such striking a motion in the creature. I would say the composition isn''t exactly perfect, but the sheer emotion and whimsical nature of the image totally and captures the viewer.', '2012-05-01 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756737, 1011462, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice title has that crooked staring out of a train feel.</td>', 'nice title has that crooked staring out of a train feel.', '2012-05-01 16:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756738, 1011298, 138253, '<td valign="top">Fantastic pan/blur while keeping a clean subject. I''m giving this a 10 as it''s the perfect fit with the challenge and a good shot. I feel the motion in this - it''s making me dizzy even keeping it on screen long enough to make sure i don''t see any ''photoshop lines'' and type this up.</td>', 'Fantastic pan/blur while keeping a clean subject. I''m giving this a 10 as it''s the perfect fit with the challenge and a good shot. I feel the motion in this - it''s making me dizzy even keeping it on screen long enough to make sure i don''t see any ''photoshop lines'' and type this up.', '2012-05-01 16:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756739, 1011979, 12611, '<td valign="top">wonderful graphic quality, couldn''t be better hand drawn.</td>', 'wonderful graphic quality, couldn''t be better hand drawn.', '2012-05-01 16:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756740, 1011907, 132996, '<td valign="top">The jagged lines in this image convey a severe sense of tension. I also like the subtle grunge overlay. The lines throw the viewer all over the image; at the same time however, there''s a crucial order, as all of the lines eventually lead back to your subject.</td>', 'The jagged lines in this image convey a severe sense of tension. I also like the subtle grunge overlay. The lines throw the viewer all over the image; at the same time however, there''s a crucial order, as all of the lines eventually lead back to your subject.', '2012-05-01 16:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756743, 1011454, 132996, '<td valign="top">Your title is perfect, this is for sure a riot of colors. This image though, still conveys a lot of psychological emotion. My eyes are drawn to the expressions on the riders'' faces, even amidst all that chaos. In addition to the emotion on their faces, there''s also very subtle connections that they have with each other. This all adds to the composition of the image.</td>', 'Your title is perfect, this is for sure a riot of colors. This image though, still conveys a lot of psychological emotion. My eyes are drawn to the expressions on the riders'' faces, even amidst all that chaos. In addition to the emotion on their faces, there''s also very subtle connections that they have with each other. This all adds to the composition of the image.', '2012-05-01 16:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6756745, 1011298, 132996, '<td valign="top">This image has so much potential, but I think you didn''t go all the way with it. For example, you could of gone with an Alice in Wonderland theme and dressed her in some sort of fantasy clothes. I do appreciate the overall quality of the image (e.g. sharpness).</td>', 'This image has so much potential, but I think you didn''t go all the way with it. For example, you could of gone with an Alice in Wonderland theme and dressed her in some sort of fantasy clothes. I do appreciate the overall quality of the image (e.g. sharpness).', '2012-05-01 16:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
