(6759221, 1011878, 61971, '<td valign="top">Looking through this challenge I see a lot of folks got motion panning confused with motion blur. Aside from that the hand blur is the main thing that is catching my eye. What I like about it is the expression around the facial area appears to be dreamy and surreal.</td>', 'Looking through this challenge I see a lot of folks got motion panning confused with motion blur. Aside from that the hand blur is the main thing that is catching my eye. What I like about it is the expression around the facial area appears to be dreamy and surreal.', '2012-05-04 00:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
