(6760136, 1011298, 109387, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments guys! :)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dennisheckman:</b></div><hr/><i> I just want to know if the coffee is Italian Roast? (-; </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Dennis I didn''t understand your question :)</td>', 'Thank you for all your comments guys! :) Originally posted by Dennisheckman: I just want to know if the coffee is Italian Roast? (-;   Dennis I didn''t understand your question :)', '2012-05-05 05:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
