(6760410, 1011298, 107708, '<td valign="top">Panning is a photography technique that freezes a moving subject while adding motion blur to the background, or visa versa, giving the viewer a distinct sense of movement in the image and this superb shot achieves this beautifully.<br/> <br/>just my thoughts :)</td>', 'Panning is a photography technique that freezes a moving subject while adding motion blur to the background, or visa versa, giving the viewer a distinct sense of movement in the image and this superb shot achieves this beautifully. just my thoughts :)', '2012-05-05 15:02:49.000000', NULL, 0),
